{"id":"n93380-1-10","stage":3,"title":"식사량 · 饭量","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93380-1-10-1","ko":"식사량을 줄이지 않고 살을 빼는 방법은 없을까?","zh":"有没有不用减少食量也能减肥的方法呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"식사량을","meaning":"饭量，食量","explanation":"식사량：饭量，食量；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"식사량","audio":"/audio/4199f0597c82f27d4355.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93380","senseId":"1","lemma":"식사량","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"식사량을","audio":"/audio/3dc70f89bf4e9d22f089.mp3"}},{"text":"줄이지","meaning":"减少，缩少，缩减","explanation":"줄이다：减少，缩少，缩减；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"줄이다","audio":"/audio/cd093d6c487c80cfcc0c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62102","senseId":"2","lemma":"줄이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄이지","audio":"/audio/09fd7a41d81859801b99.mp3"}},{"text":"않고","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않고","audio":"/audio/0a35d31b8ad5abd7d1f4.mp3"}},{"text":"살을","meaning":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","explanation":"살 指人身上的肉；살이 찌다 是长胖，살이 빠지다 是变瘦，살을 빼다 是减重。这里不是梳子齿、年龄或皮肤义。","readings":[{"term":"살","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66883","senseId":"1","lemma":"살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"살을","audio":"/audio/52da6c8617f35997f4c4.mp3"}},{"text":"빼는","meaning":"减肥，减重","explanation":"빼다：减肥，减重；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"빼다","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85714","senseId":"9","lemma":"빼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빼는","audio":"/audio/aeaf7aaad05e51160e06.mp3"}},{"text":"방법은","meaning":"方法，办法","explanation":"방법：方法，办法；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"방법","audio":"/audio/a4a801d526fb251193b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65531","senseId":"1","lemma":"방법","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방법은","audio":"/audio/db18c55957df95e609a3.mp3"}},{"text":"없을까?","meaning":"不可以，不能","explanation":"없다：不可以，不能；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"6","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없을까","audio":"/audio/41b085a28423a60bd513.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4199f0597c82f27d","term":"식사량","zh":"饭量，食量","audio":"/audio/4199f0597c82f27d4355.mp3","entryId":"93380","definition":"吃东西的量。","pronunciation":["식싸량"]},{"id":"cd093d6c487c80cf","term":"줄이다","zh":"减少，缩少，缩减","audio":"/audio/cd093d6c487c80cfcc0c.mp3","entryId":"62102","definition":"使数或量变得比原来少。","pronunciation":["주리다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"d804a5a98c800c56","term":"살","zh":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","audio":"/audio/d804a5a98c800c56a6e4.mp3","entryId":"66883","definition":"身上的肉（与体重有关）","pronunciation":["살"]},{"id":"2a9a5583b5aa1796","term":"빼다","zh":"减肥，减重","audio":"/audio/2a9a5583b5aa17960d82.mp3","entryId":"85714","definition":"使肥肉或体重等减少。","pronunciation":["빼ː다"]},{"id":"a4a801d526fb2511","term":"방법","zh":"方法，办法","audio":"/audio/a4a801d526fb251193b0.mp3","entryId":"65531","definition":"处理某事的手段或方式。","pronunciation":["방법"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"不可以，不能","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"某事不可能。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/5b566225f7e0fd1bc8d1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n93380-1-10-2","ko":"정말 열심히 운동을 하면 돼.","zh":"只要认真锻炼就行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173"